**Forest-people as prey.** Rootstalkers now actively hunt the Weald's remaining forest families. This is new. Older stories and any NPC who left the Weald years ago will not know it; anyone who has been under canopy this season will. A Rootstalker that catches a scent of the holdfast will prefer that trail over the party's unless the party has already drawn it.

This does not change the Rootstalker stat block. It changes what the forest is using them for.

